 ilistic and Bayesian machine learning\, emphasizing approximate inference
 \, variational and Monte Carlo methods\, Gaussian processes\, graphical a
 nd state-space models\, calibration\, and decisions under uncertainty. In
 cludes Bayesian optimization and uncertainty-aware deep learning. The rev
